== Evaluation ==
;Pros
* [[Shared Burden]] is an effective debuff against clumps of enemies.
* Possesses a [[self heal]].
* Can inflict [[Deep Wound]].
;Cons
* Henchmen cannot prioritize [[interrupt]]s.
* Only 7 skills outside the Raisu Palace and Imperial Sanctum missions.

